card.text:
Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each card type among cards in your graveyard.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, you may pay {1}{B}{G}. If you do, return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.
Equip {4}

Flying, vigilance
Ward {2}
If you would draw one or more cards, instead surveil 1, then draw that many cards. (To surveil 1, look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)

Whenever equipped creature attacks, it juggles. (Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one into your graveyard. Put a +1/+1 counter on that creature if the juggled card has greater mana value than it.)
During your turn, each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has shielded. (Prevent all damage that would be dealt to it.)
Equip {2}
